\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Telgar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/22474-they-finally-did-it?p=22896#post22896\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Uh, they also killed the White Wolf Wikis... and there wasn't a project to back them up since I don't believe there was any advanced notice on <i>them</i> dying.</div> </div> </div> </div>Uh, no? That the wiki was going to move to Onyx Path was announced <i>in the same post as the one about the forums</i>. In said post it was also stated that they <i>were</i> able to back up the data, and it has been confirmed by Ian that this <i>does</i> mean that the new OPP wiki <i>will</i> have the old wikis data.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eddy</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">On December 1st, the site is going to be replaced with a new one showcasing all of our license partners. The goal is to move to a site designed to provide information on key parts of the White Wolf community. Unfortunately, <b>this includes removing wiki</b> and forum functionality, but <b>we are working with Onyx Path Publishing to host an improved forum and wiki experience</b> on their site. [...]</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">While <b>we are able to export out wiki information</b>, we aren't able to do the same for the forums in a way that preserves user privacy</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/default714d.html?g=posts&amp;m=1723326#post1723326\" target=\"_blank\">http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/d...26#post1723326</a><br /> <br /> What's the issue, gentlemen?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":508,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/508-sikker","user":"sikker","date":". 12-05-2013, 08:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/508-sikker","name":"sikker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T06:37:16-08:00","id":23719,"title":"","content":"Is it not ok to use the unofficial wiki? It still works. <a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Main_Page\" target=\"_blank\">http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Main_Page</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ortam + Malkavia makes a Requiem fun.<br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Posts in this colour are Persuasion.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\">Posts in this colour are Seduction.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this colour are Intimidation.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/57-solomon-birch","name":"solomon birch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar57_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"289"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T06:57:04-08:00","id":23732,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>solomon birch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/22474-they-finally-did-it?p=23719#post23719\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it not ok to use the unofficial wiki? It still works. <a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Main_Page\" target=\"_blank\">http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Main_Page</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly I always mixed up the Official and Unofficial Wiki. I didn't really see the point in their being two, but I kept forgetting which bookmark was which.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-05T08:17:49-08:00","id":23770,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/22474-they-finally-did-it?p=23732#post23732\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Honestly I always mixed up the Official and Unofficial Wiki. I didn't really see the point in their being two, but I kept forgetting which bookmark was which.</div> </div> </div> </div>The unofficial Wiki came first.<br /> <br /> There were three official Wikis: one for the World of Darkness, one for Exalted, and one for everything else.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}